  "turkish_executive_summary": "SPRINT 09.40 Y\u00d6NET\u0130C\u0130 \u00d6ZET\u0130:\n1. Sprint 09.39 S\u0131f\u0131r Likidasyon Riski Varsay\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n D\u00fczeltilmesi:\n   - Sprint 09.39'da 1.0x kald\u0131ra\u00e7l\u0131 pasif carry portf\u00f6y\u00fc i\u00e7in verilen 's\u0131f\u0131r likidasyon riski' h\u00fckm\u00fc finansal olarak ge\u00e7ersiz k\u0131l\u0131nm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. \u0130zole teminat hesab\u0131nda Spot BTC sermaye kazan\u00e7lar\u0131 Spot c\u00fczdanda rehin kald\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan vadeli hesaba otomatik olarak aktar\u0131lmaz. 2024 bo\u011fa piyasas\u0131nda BTC 42.283'ten 109.588 USDT'ye (+%159) rallisi s\u0131ras\u0131nda izole k\u0131sa pozisyon 11 Kas\u0131m 2024 saat 21:15'te (BTC=88.378 USDT) teminat tamamlama seviyesinin alt\u0131na d\u00fc\u015ferek ZORUNLU L\u0130K\u0130DASYONA u\u011fram\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. SOL carry ise 18 Mart 2024'te (SOL=208 USDT) likidasyona u\u011fram\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. D\u00fczeltilmi\u015f s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131rma: ISOLATED_MARGIN_VULNERABLE_TO_RALLIES_WITHOUT_COLLATERAL_INJECTION.\n2. Sermaye Tahsis S\u00f6zle\u015fmesi ve Bilan\u00e7o Ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131:\n   - 10.000 USDT sermaye i\u00e7in standart s\u00f6zle\u015fme: 5.000 USDT Spot, 2.500 USDT Perp marjini, 2.500 USDT Nakit rezervi. Kald\u0131ra\u00e7: Portf\u00f6y d\u00fczeyinde 0.5x, vadeli marjin d\u00fczeyinde 2.0x. Likidasyondan korunmak i\u00e7in nakit rezerv zorunludur.\n3. \u00c7oklu Enstr\u00fcman Veri Taml\u0131\u011f\u0131:\n   - BTCUSDT: 14 ayl\u0131k 40.800 bar Spot, Vadeli i\u015flem ve G\u00f6sterge fiyat\u0131 kline'lar\u0131 ve 1.275 fonlama ile tamd\u0131r. ETHUSDT ve SOLUSDT: 14 ayl\u0131k fonlama verisi (%100 SHA-256) mevcut olmakla birlikte, 15m vadeli i\u015flem ve g\u00f6sterge fiyat\u0131 kline'lar\u0131 eksiktir. Fail-Closed ilkesi gere\u011fince ETH ve SOL i\u00e7in bar i\u00e7i likidasyon sim\u00fclat\u00f6r\u00fc \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lamaz.\n4. Fonlama Yay\u0131l\u0131m Kal\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve Ge\u00e7i\u015f Maliyeti Engeli:\n   - Varl\u0131klar aras\u0131 ortalama fonlama fark\u0131 yaln\u0131zca 0.71 bps'dir ve avantaj her ~16 saatte bir (2.0 uzla\u015fma) tersine d\u00f6nmektedir. Buna kar\u015f\u0131n pozisyon rotasyonu 38.0 bps (Maker) ve 72.0 bps (Taker) ge\u00e7i\u015f s\u00fcrt\u00fcnmesi do\u011furur. Maliyetin amorti edilmesi i\u00e7in ortalama 53.7 uzla\u015fma (17.9 g\u00fcn) kesintisiz avantaj gerekir. Dinamik ge\u00e7i\u015f kesinlikle imkans\u0131zd\u0131r.\n5. Portf\u00f6y Getirisi ve Risksiz Faiz Kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131:\n   - Likidasyon riski ta\u015f\u0131mayan %50 nakit destekli carry portf\u00f6yleri y\u0131ll\u0131kland\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f %2.7 - %2.8 net getiri \u00fcretmektedir. Bu getiri, 2024 y\u0131l\u0131ndaki %5.25'lik risksiz ABD Hazine Bonosu faizinin neredeyse yar\u0131s\u0131 kadard\u0131r. Delta-n\u00f6tr kripto fonlama carry stratejisi, operasyonel ve likidasyon riskleri dikkate al\u0131nd\u0131\u011f\u0131nda ekonomik \u00fcst\u00fcnl\u00fck ta\u015f\u0131mamaktad\u0131r.\n6. Karar Kap\u0131s\u0131: EXPLORATORY_ECONOMIC_FEASIBILITY. APPROVAL4 = FALSE korunmaktad\u0131r."
